mooth scroll, active nav. NOTE: the smooth-scroll handler intercepts `a[href^=\"#\"]` — important for my \"Apply Now\" buttons linking to `careers.html#apply` — actually those are `href=\"#apply\"`-style? No, they'd be on the same page: `href=\"#apply\"`. The smooth scroll handler will preventDefault and scrollIntoView — good.\n\nIMPORTANT for the \"Apply Now\" prefill: I'll use `href=\"?position=Technical Analyst#apply\"`? Hmm, if on same page, `href=\"?position=...#apply\"` — the browser treats `?position=` as navigating to the same page with query param — reloads. That's OK but with the base target... wait, index.html has `<base target=\"_blank\">` but other pages don't. Let me check: why-choose-us.html and contact.html don't have `<base target=\"_blank\">`. Only index.html has it (twice, which is weird). So on careers.html I won't include base.\n\nFor Apply Now buttons: simplest robust approach that works with static hosting: `href=\"careers.html#apply\"` and use JS with data attributes instead of query params. Actually since the job cards and the form are on the SAME page, I can do `href=\"#apply\" data-position=\"Technical Analyst\"` and JS sets the select value on click. That avoids URL query parsing entirely and works perfectly. \n\nNow the design plan for careers.html:\n\n1. **Hero**: \"Build Your Career With Reality FX\" + subtitle + 2 buttons (View Open Positions → #positions, Submit General Application → #talent-pool). Background: dark gradient + subtle chart art (reuse the SVG chart-art pattern from why-choose-us or a candlestick motif). I'll add a subtle CSS background with radial gradients + maybe reuse the sweep. Keep it premium.\n\n2. **Why Join** (6 cards): use `.card-grid` + `.card` with emoji icons or SVG icons. The spec uses emojis (📈🌍🎓💰🤝🚀). I'll use the emoji in a `.card-icon`-like styled span — or inline SVG for premium look. Emojis are fine and match spec; I'll wrap in a styled icon box. Let me use SVG icons for a more premium look? The spec explicitly lists emojis. Emojis are simpler and match. I'll use emojis in a styled span.\n\n3. **Our Culture**: two-col — text left, 4 core values (Integrity, Excellence, Innovation, Discipline) right as value chips/cards. Maybe a gold-underline list or 2x2 grid of value cards with numbers 01-04.\n\n4. **Open Positions**: grouped by department with headers, `.job-listing` cards (existing CSS!) enhanced. Each card: title, department badge, meta (Employment, Location, Experience), description, salary (some), skills (`.job-requirements`), Apply button → `#apply` with data-position. I'll build ~12-14 positions across 6 departments.\n\nWait — the spec says job cards should have: Job Title, Department, Employment Type, Location, Experience, Short Description, Salary (if applicable), Skills Required, Apply Button. The existing `.job-listing` CSS supports title + meta + description + requirements. I'll use it and add a `.job-card-head` with department badge. Add new CSS where needed.\n\nDepartments & positions — I'll include these (representative, covering all 6 departments):\n- Trading: Technical Analyst, Fundamental Analyst, Risk Manager, Junior Trader, Trading Mentor\n- Education: Forex Instructor, Trading Coach\n- Marketing: Digital Marketing Specialist, Content Creator\n- Sales: Sales Consultant, Client Success Manager\n- Technology: Frontend Developer, UI/UX Designer, Data Analyst\n- Administration: Operations Manager, Virtual Assistant\n\nThat's 16 — a good number. Hmm, maybe trim to ~14 to keep it manageable. Let me do:\nTrading (5): Technical Analyst, Fundamental Analyst, Risk Manager, Trading Mentor, Junior Trader\nEducation (2): Forex Instructor, Trading Coach\nMarketing (2): Digital Marketing Specialist, Content Creator\nSales (2): Sales Consultant, Client Success Manager\nTechnology (3): Frontend Developer, UI/UX Designer, Data Analyst\nAdmin (2): Operations Manager, Virtual Assistant\n\nTotal 16. That's substantial but demonstrates the \"Recruitment Hub\". OK.\n\n5. **Hiring Process**: timeline with 6 steps (Application → Initial Review → Skills Assessment → Interview → Final Decision → Welcome). Vertical timeline with gold line and numbered dots, description under each.\n\n6. **Benefits** (8): Remote Work, Professional Development, Flexible Hours, Performance Bonuses, Mentorship, Certification Opportunities, Networking, Career Advancement — grid with icons (emoji or SVG).\n\n7. **FAQ**: reuse `.accordion-item` pattern — 5 questions from spec.\n\n8. **General Application / Talent Pool**: section with the general application form (name, email, phone, country, CV upload, LinkedIn, cover letter, areas of interest, years of experience). Netlify form.\n\n9. **Job Application**: the spec wants a separate job application form including position (pre-filled). I'll add the job application form in the Apply section — the Apply buttons scroll to it and prefill the position select. Where to put it? Maybe two forms: \"Apply for a Position\" (with position select) and \"Join Our Talent Pool\" (general). Or combine into one apply section with a toggle? Simpler: two stacked form blocks in the apply section, each with its own Netlify form name. Actually the spec says \"two forms: General Application + Job Application\". I'll build both:\n   - `#apply` — Job Application form (has Position applying for select, expected salary, earliest start date, portfolio/GitHub + base fields)\n   - `#talent-pool` — General Application form (base fields only)\n   \n   The \"View Open Positions\" hero button → #positions. \"Submit General Application\" → #talent-pool. Each job card Apply → #apply with position prefilled.\n\n10. **Footer CTA**: \"Ready to build your future with Reality FX?\" + Apply Today button → #apply. I'll put this as a `.cta-section`.\n\n11. Footer: standard.\n\nCSS additions needed:\n- `.hero` variant already handles center text.\n- Why cards: reuse `.card` + `.card-icon` (but card-icon is 48px svg gold color). For emojis I'll make a `.why-card .emoji-icon` style or just reuse card-icon with span. I'll add `.icon-emoji` style.\n- Culture values: `.value-grid`, `.value-card` (with big number + label).\n- Job cards: enhance existing `.job-listing` with `.job-head`, `.job-badge` (department), `.job-salary`, `.job-actions`. The existing `.job-meta span` etc. exist. I'll add a few new classes: `.job-listing .job-head`, `.job-department`, `.job-salary`.\n- Timeline: `.timeline`, `.timeline-item`, `.timeline-dot`, `.timeline-content`.\n- Benefits: `.benefit-grid`, `.benefit-item` with icon.\n- Apply section: `.careers-form` exists.\n- Maybe `.section-heading-left`? Not needed.\n\nAlso need responsive tweaks for timeline & new grids (add to the @media blocks or a new media block at end).\n\nSince the site's CSS is already big, I'll append a \"Careers Page\" section at the end of style.css with all new styles, reusing existing vars/classes.\n\nAlso — the `.reveal` class: main.js adds `visible` when intersecting. Elements with `.reveal` start `opacity:0`. For a preview without JS... main.js IS loaded via `<script src=\"js/main.js\">`, so it works in the preview if JS runs. In my preview injections, the page loads main.js fine (it's a file on the same origin? No! The preview server serves ONLY the registered HTML file — `js/main.js` would 404!). So in the preview, main.js won't load and `.reveal` elements stay invisible. For the preview I'll inject a small script to add 'visible' to all .reveal. Fine.\n\nAlso note the accordion needs JS to work — in preview without main.js it won't. Not critical for the preview screenshot.\n\nOne more consideration: **the mobile menu & hamburger** — fine.\n\n**Important**: the `<base target=\"_blank\">` — NOT on other pages, so don't add to careers.html.\n\nNow — forms. Use Netlify form conventions like contact.html (`name=\"...\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\"` with `form-name` hidden field). For file upload (CV), Netlify supports file inputs with data-netlify forms? Netlify forms do support file uploads in recent versions. I'll include `<input type=\"file\" name=\"cv\">` — it works with Netlify forms. Also add `netlify-honeypot=\"bot-field\"`.\n\nJob Application form fields: Full name, Email, Phone, Country, Position applying for (select with all positions + \"General\"), Expected salary (optional), Earliest start date (date input), CV upload, LinkedIn (optional), Portfolio/GitHub (optional), Cover letter, Areas of interest (select/checkbox), Years of experience (select), plus maybe \"How did you hear about us\". Keep to spec: full name, email, phone, country, CV, LinkedIn, cover letter, areas of interest, years of experience + position, expected salary, earliest start date, portfolio/GitHub.\n\nGeneral Application: full name, email, phone, country, CV, LinkedIn (optional), cover letter, areas of interest, years of experience.\n\nBoth big forms will make the page long but it's a recruitment hub — fine.\n\nLet me now think about the JS for prefill: Inline script in careers.html:\n```html\n<script>\n  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n    // Prefill position from Apply Now buttons\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-position]').forEach(function (btn) {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n        var select = document.getElementById('position');\n        if (select) select.value = btn.getAttribute('data-position');\n      });\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n```\nWait — but main.js's smooth-scroll handler intercepts `a[href^=\"#\"]` clicks and scrollIntoView — it also prevents default. My data-position listener runs too (both listeners fire). Order: my listener sets the select; main.js scrolls. Both fine. But careful: main.js only runs if loaded (it is, on real hosting). In preview, main.js 404s, but my inline script still works.\n\nAlso for the file input, Netlify needs `enctype`? Netlify handles it automatically for data-netlify forms. Actually for file uploads, Netlify requires the form to have `method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\"` and file inputs are supported — yes, Netlify forms support file uploads (they get emailed as links). OK.\n\nNow let me write the careers.html. This will be a large file. Let me be thorough but efficient.\n\nStructure:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  meta, title \"Careers — Reality FX\", description\n  fonts, css\n</head>\n<body>\n  <!-- Navigation --> (standard, Careers is not in nav list — hmm)\n  <div class=\"mobile-menu\"> (standard)\n  \n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <section class=\"hero careers-hero\" style=\"...\">\n    <div class=\"container\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Join Our Team</span>\n      <h1>Build Your Career With <span class=\"accent\">Reality FX</span></h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-subhead\" ...>Join a team passionate about financial markets, innovation, education, and helping traders reach their full potential.</p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:1.5rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n        <a href=\"#positions\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-large\">View Open Positions</a>\n        <a href=\"#talent-pool\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-large\">Submit General Application</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n```\n\nHmm — for the hero background \"premium trading office\": I can't easily include a real image (no asset). I'll create a premium dark background with layered radial gradients + a subtle candlestick SVG pattern or reuse the sweep. Let me add a `.careers-hero` background style: dark bg + gold radial glows + maybe a faint grid pattern via CSS gradient. Good enough and premium.\n\n```html\n  <!-- Why Join -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"why-join\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Why Join Reality FX</span>\n        <h2>More Than a Job — A Career</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-grid why-grid reveal\">\n        6 cards with emoji + title + short text\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n```\n\nCards:\n1. 📈 Career Growth — \"Clear progression paths...\"\n2. 🌍 Remote Opportunities — \"Work from anywhere...\"\n3. 🎓 Continuous Learning — \"Ongoing training...\"\n4. 💰 Performance-Based Rewards — \"Your results are rewarded...\"\n5. 🤝 Supportive Team — \"Collaborative, respectful...\"\n6. 🚀 Real Financial Projects — \"Work on live market projects...\"\n\n```html\n  <!-- Culture -->\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"background:var(--bg-deep);\" id=\"culture\">\n    <div class=\"container two-col reveal\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Culture</span>\n        <h2>Who We Are</h2>\n        <p>At Reality FX, we believe in discipline, continuous improvement, integrity, and data-driven decision making. We value people who enjoy solving problems, learning new skills, and contributing to a collaborative environment.</p>\n        <a href=\"#positions\" class=\"btn btn-dark\">See Open Positions</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"value-grid\">\n        4 value cards: 01 Integrity, 02 Excellence, 03 Innovation, 04 Discipline\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n```\n\n```html\n  <!-- Positions -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"positions\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Open Positions</span>\n        <h2>Join the Team</h2>\n        <p>Find the role that fits your skills...</p>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Trading</h3>\n        <div class=\"job-listing\"> ... </div> ×5\n      </div>\n      ... etc\n    </div>\n  </section>\n```\n\nEach job card:\n```html\n<div class=\"job-listing\">\n  <div class=\"job-head\">\n    <div>\n      <h3>Technical Analyst</h3>\n      <span class=\"job-department\">Trading</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"job-meta\">\n    <span>⏱ Employment: Full-Time</span>\n    <span>🌍 Location: Remote</span>\n    <span>📊 Experience: 2+ Years</span>\n    <span>💰 Salary: R25,000 – R40,000 / mo</span> (some)\n  </div>\n  <p>Short description...</p>\n  <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n    <li>Technical Analysis</li>\n    ...\n  </ul>\n  <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Technical Analyst\">Apply Now</a>\n</div>\n```\n\nFor the meta, I'll use text labels with small svg/emoji. Keep emojis minimal — maybe use plain text labels: \"Full-Time · Remote · 2+ Years\". The existing `.job-meta span` styles uppercase muted text. Good.\n\n```html\n  <!-- Hiring Process (timeline) -->\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"background:var(--bg-deep);\" id=\"process\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">...</div>\n      <div class=\"timeline reveal\">\n        <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n          <div class=\"timeline-dot\">1</div>\n          <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n            <h3>Application</h3>\n            <p>Submit your CV and cover letter through our application form.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        ... 6 steps\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n```\n\n```html\n  <!-- Benefits -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"benefits\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">...</div>\n      <div class=\"benefit-grid reveal\">\n        8 benefit items with emoji + title + short desc\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n```\n\n```html\n  <!-- FAQ -->\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"background:var(--bg-deep);\" id=\"faq\">\n    accordion items (5)\n  </section>\n```\n\n```html\n  <!-- Apply / Forms -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"apply\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Apply</span>\n        <h2>Apply for a Position</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"careers-form reveal\">\n        <form name=\"job-application\" ...> ... </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"background:var(--bg-deep);\" id=\"talent-pool\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Talent Pool</span>\n        <h2>Don't See the Perfect Role?</h2>\n        <p>Submit your CV anyway — we keep a talent pool for future openings.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"careers-form reveal\">\n        <form name=\"general-application\" ...> ... </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n```\n\n```html\n  <!-- CTA -->\n  <section class=\"cta-section\">\n    <div class=\"container reveal\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n      <h2>Ready to Build Your Future With Reality FX?</h2>\n      <p>...</p>\n      <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-large\">Apply Today</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\"> standard footer </footer>\n\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script> prefill logic </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\nForm fields for job application:\n- Full Name * (text)\n- Email * (email)\n- Phone (tel)\n- Country (text)\n- Position Applying For * (select with all 16 positions + General Application)\n- Expected Salary (optional) (text)\n- Earliest Start Date (date)\n- Years of Experience (select: <1, 1–2, 3–5, 5–10, 10+)\n- Areas of Interest (select: Trading, Education, Marketing, Sales, Technology, Administration, Other)\n- CV Upload (file, required?) — make optional to be safe? Spec: CV upload. I'll make it required for job app? Let me keep it optional (required can be annoying). Actually spec says collects CV. I'll mark as optional to avoid blocking. Hmm, for a careers form CV is pretty essential. I'll make it required on the job application? If someone wants to just apply with LinkedIn... I'll leave required off. Keep it simple: optional file upload.\n- LinkedIn (optional) (url)\n- Portfolio / GitHub (optional) (url)\n- Cover Letter (textarea)\n\nGeneral application: same minus position/expected salary/start date/portfolio? Spec says general collects: full name, email, phone, country, CV, LinkedIn (optional), cover letter, areas of interest, years of experience. OK.\n\nLayout: use `.form-row` for pairs.\n\nNow the CSS additions. Let me write them:\n\n```css\n/* ============================================\n   CAREERS PAGE\n   ============================================ */\n\n/* Hero */\n.careers-hero {\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 0%, rgba(201,162,39,0.08), transparent 55%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 100%, rgba(201,162,39,0.05), transparent 50%),\n    var(--bg-primary);\n}\n\n/* Why cards */\n.why-grid .card { text-align: left; }\n.icon-emoji {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 52px;\n  height: 52px;\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  background: rgba(201,162,39,0.1);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n/* Values */\n.value-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n}\n.value-card {\n  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #141414, #0c0c0c);\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.value-card:hover { border-color: var(--border-subtle); transform: translateY(-3px); }\n.value-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 2.2rem;\n  color: var(--accent-gold);\n  opacity: 0.55;\n  line-height: 1;\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n.value-card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }\n.value-card p { font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0; }\n\n/* Job listings */\n.department-group { margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }\n.department-title {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent-gold);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  padding-bottom: 0.75rem;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n}\n.department-title::after { content:''; flex:1; height:1px; background: var(--glass-border); }  -- maybe not needed since border-bottom.\n.job-head { display:flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:1rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem; }\n.job-head h3 { color: var(--accent-gold); font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:0.35rem; }\n.job-badge {\n  font-size:0.65rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.15em; text-transform:uppercase;\n  padding:0.35rem 0.85rem; border-radius:20px;\n  background: rgba(201,162,39,0.12); color: var(--accent-gold);\n  border:1px solid var(--border-subtle); white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.job-salary { color: var(--accent-gold); font-weight:600; font-size:0.9rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem; }\n.job-listing .btn { margin-top: 0.5rem; }\n```\n\nNote existing `.job-listing h3 { color: var(--accent-gold); ... }` already exists — fine, keep.\n\nTimeline:\n```css\n.timeline { position: relative; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 2rem; }\n.timeline::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 8px; top: 8px; bottom: 8px;\n  width: 1px;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-gold), rgba(201,162,39,0.1));\n}\n.timeline-item { position: relative; padding: 0 0 2.5rem 2.5rem; }\n.timeline-item:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }\n.timeline-dot {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0; top: 4px;\n  width: 18px; height: 18px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--bg-deep);\n  border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 0.55rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-gold);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(201,162,39,0.08);\n}\n```\n\nHmm, timeline-dot with a number inside 18px — small. Let me make dots 22px with number. Actually simpler: dot without number, but a gold circle, and number in content. Or bigger numbered circles. Let me do numbered circles 28px:\n\n```css\n.timeline { position: relative; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.timeline::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 27px; top: 12px; bottom: 12px;\n  width: 2px;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-gold), rgba(201,162,39,0.08));\n}\n.timeline-item { position: relative; padding: 0 0 2.5rem 4.5rem; }\n.timeline-item:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }\n.timeline-dot {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0; top: 0;\n  width: 56px; height: 56px; -- hmm large\n```\n\nLet me simplify: numbered circle 32px:\n```css\n.timeline-dot {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 12px; top: 0;\n  width: 32px; height: 32px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1c1c1c, #0d0d0d);\n  border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);\n  color: var(--accent-gold);\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n.timeline-content {\n  background: var(--glass-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.timeline-content:hover { border-color: var(--border-subtle); transform: translateY(-2px); }\n.timeline-content h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; color: var(--text-body); }\n.timeline-content p { font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; }\n```\n\nThe line: left: 27px centers on 32px dot (12 + 16 = 28 ≈ center). Good.\n\nBenefits:\n```css\n.benefit-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n}\n.benefit-item {\n  background: var(--glass-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.benefit-item:hover { border-color: var(--border-subtle); transform: translateY(-3px); }\n.benefit-item .icon-emoji { margin-bottom: 1rem; }\n.benefit-item h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }\n.benefit-item p { font-size: 0.82rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; }\n```\n\nCareers form: existing `.careers-form`. Maybe add `.careers-form .form-group`... already fine.\n\nFAQ: reuse accordion classes.\n\nResponsive additions:\n```css\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .value-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .job-head { flex-direction: column; }\n  .timeline-item { padding-left: 3.5rem; }\n}\n```\n\nNow — the number of job positions: 16 cards with descriptions. This makes the HTML file big but fine. Let me write descriptions concisely.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the job count to keep the page focused — I'll do a solid set: \nTrading: Technical Analyst, Fundamental Analyst, Risk Manager, Trading Mentor, Junior Trader (5)\nEducation: Forex Instructor, Trading Coach (2)\nMarketing: Digital Marketing Specialist, Content Creator (2)\nSales: Sales Consultant, Client Success Manager (2)\nTechnology: Frontend Developer, UI/UX Designer, Data Analyst (3)\nAdministration: Operations Manager, Virtual Assistant (2)\n\n= 16 positions. Each ~12 lines HTML. OK.\n\nNow, about the hero background \"premium trading office with monitors\": I'll add a subtle SVG scene? That's a lot of work. Alternative: use the existing `.chart-art-wrap` + `.chart-art` SVG? That's on why-choose-us. For careers hero, I could place a small candlestick SVG next to text... The other pages' heroes are text-centered without images (services, industries, programs, contact heroes are centered text only). So a centered-text hero with a premium gradient background fits the site convention perfectly. I'll add gold radial glows + a faint repeating grid pattern for the \"trading desk\" vibe:\n\n```css\n.careers-hero {\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 20%, rgba(201,162,39,0.10), transparent 55%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 80%, rgba(201,162,39,0.07), transparent 50%),\n    linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px),\n    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px),\n    var(--bg-primary);\n  background-size: auto, auto, 60px 60px, 60px 60px, auto;\n}\n```\n\nThat gives a subtle grid = trading desk monitors vibe. \n\nNow write the files. First careers.html — this is long; let me write it carefully.\n\nFor the form selects, the \"Position Applying For\" options should list all 16 positions + \"General Application\".\n\nArea of interest select: Trading, Education, Marketing, Sales, Technology, Administration, Other.\n\nYears of experience: \"Less than 1 year\", \"1–2 years\", \"3–5 years\", \"5–10 years\", \"10+ years\".\n\nFor CV file input: `<input type=\"file\" name=\"cv\" accept=\".pdf,.doc,.docx\">` — Netlify forms support file upload. Add `enctype`? Netlify docs: for file uploads in forms, it works with `data-netlify=\"true\"` — no special enctype needed. OK.\n\nInline prefill script:\n```html\n<script>\n  // Prefill the \"Position Applying For\" field when an Apply Now button is clicked\n  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n    var positionSelect = document.getElementById('position');\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-position]').forEach(function (btn) {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n        if (positionSelect) positionSelect.value = btn.getAttribute('data-position');\n      });\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n```\n\nNote: main.js's smooth-scroll handles `a[href^=\"#\"]` clicks — my Apply buttons are `href=\"#apply\"` so both work. But wait — the buttons inside `.job-listing` have `data-position`; main.js smooth scroll preventDefault + scrollIntoView. My handler sets the select. Both listeners run in order of registration: main.js is loaded FIRST (before inline script), so main.js's listener runs first (scrolls), then mine (sets select). Both fine.\n\nAlso the hero \"View Open Positions\" → href=\"#positions\". OK.\n\nOne catch: main.js adds `.active` to nav links matching current page. Careers page's own nav has no Careers link — no active link will highlight, same as evaluation.html (no eval link in nav... wait, eval page: nav has the \"Free Evaluation\" btn with href evaluation.html — main.js would add 'active' to it. Whatever, not important).\n\nLet me also double-check: the `.hero` class has `min-height:100vh` but inline style overrides on other pages. I'll use `<section class=\"hero careers-hero\" style=\"min-height:70vh;padding-top:120px;\">`. And careers-hero CSS adds background.\n\nAlso — `.careers-hero h1` — the site has `.careers-hero` CSS already: `min-height:50vh;padding-top:120px;display:flex;align-items:center;text-align:center;` — hmm, the existing `.careers-hero` sets display:flex; align-items:center; text-align:center;. If I add class=\"hero careers-hero\", there may be conflicts (hero has min-height:100vh, display:flex; align-items:center). Combined with inline style min-height:70vh — inline wins. display:flex from both — fine. My background additions via `.careers-hero` — I'll override/extend. Actually simpler: use only `class=\"hero\"` + inline styles + a new class `.careers-hero` for the background only, but the existing `.careers-hero` rules (min-height:50vh etc.) would conflict with inline (inline wins) and add text-align:center — fine. And display:flex;align-items:center — same as hero. OK, safe to use both classes. But my background rule — existing `.careers-hero` doesn't set background, so my rule adds it. Good.\n\nWait, actually there's a subtlety: existing `.careers-hero { min-height: 50vh; padding-top: 120px; ... }` — inline `min-height:70vh` overrides. Fine.\n\nLet me now write everything. Start with careers.html.\n\nSalary examples (ZAR, since South African company — R300–R37,000 programs, WhatsApp number 072...): \n- Technical Analyst: R25,000 – R40,000/mo\n- Fundamental Analyst: R25,000 – R40,000/mo\n- Risk Manager: R30,000 – R45,000/mo\n- Trading Mentor: R20,000 – R35,000/mo\n- Junior Trader: R15,000 – R25,000/mo\n- Forex Instructor: R18,000 – R30,000/mo\n- Trading Coach: R18,000 – R28,000/mo\n- Digital Marketing Specialist: R18,000 – R30,000/mo\n- Content Creator: R12,000 – R20,000/mo\n- Sales Consultant: R12,000 + commission\n- Client Success Manager: R15,000 – R25,000/mo\n- Frontend Developer: R30,000 – R50,000/mo\n- UI/UX Designer: R22,000 – R38,000/mo\n- Data Analyst: R25,000 – R40,000/mo\n- Operations Manager: R25,000 – R40,000/mo\n- Virtual Assistant: R8,000 – R15,000/mo\n\nThese are plausible; I'll label \"Salary (negotiable)\".\n\nOK — also, I should keep `<meta name=\"description\">`.\n\nLet me write the file now. It's big; I'll write it in one write_file call.\n\nFor the \"Our Culture\" value cards, layout: two-col with text left + value-grid right (2x2).\n\nFor Benefits (8): \n- 🏠 Remote Work — \"Work from anywhere in the world with flexible arrangements.\"\n- 📚 Professional Development — \"Budget for courses, certifications, and conferences.\"\n- ⏰ Flexible Hours — \"Own your schedule while hitting your targets.\"\n- 💰 Performance Bonuses — \"Share in the success you help create.\"\n- 🧑🏫 Mentorship — \"Learn directly from senior traders and leaders.\"\n- 🎓 Certification Opportunities — \"Earn recognised credentials as you grow.\"\n- 🤝 Networking — \"Connect with a growing community of professionals.\"\n- 📈 Career Advancement — \"Clear paths to leadership and specialisation.\"\n\nFAQ (5):\n1. Can I work remotely? — Yes, most roles are remote-first...\n2. Can beginners apply? — It depends on the role. Entry-level positions (Junior Trader, Virtual Assistant, Content Creator) welcome beginners; specialist roles require experience.\n3. Is trading experience required? — Only for trading positions. Education, marketing, sales, tech, and admin roles don't require it.\n4. How long does hiring take? — Normally 1–3 weeks from application to decision.\n5. Can international applicants apply? — Yes, we welcome applicants from anywhere...\n\nNow — the hiring process timeline steps with descriptions:\n1. Application — \"Submit your CV and cover letter through the form below. It takes about 5 minutes.\"\n2. Initial Review — \"Our HR team reviews every application and shortlists candidates within 3–5 business days.\"\n3. Skills Assessment — \"A short, role-specific assessment helps us understand your strengths.\"\n4. Interview — \"Meet the team. We focus on how you think, not rehearsed answers.\"\n5. Final Decision — \"We make an offer to the right fit within a week of the final interview.\"\n6. Welcome to Reality FX — \"You will get onboarding, your equipment setup, and a mentor to help you hit the ground running.\"\n\nNow let me write careers.html. I'll keep the HTML tidy. Let me draft it fully.\n\nAlso the CTA section: \"Ready to build your future with Reality FX?\" + p + Apply Today button.\n\nFooter: copy the standard footer (Quick Links etc.).\n\nAlright, writing now. Also add \"Careers\" to... no, leave navs as-is; I'll suggest adding the link as a follow-up.\n\nOne more: the `#` anchor links — the hero \"Submit General Application\" → `#talent-pool`, \"View Open Positions\" → `#positions`.\n\nAlso — will the `data-position` on an `<a href=\"#apply\">` conflict with smooth scroll? No.\n\nLet me write the HTML now.\n\nAfter that, append CSS to style.css, then preview verify.\n\nFor the preview: register careers.html, inject compact CSS (including all new careers styles + dark buttons), inject script to unhide .reveal elements, screenshot. The new CSS additions are extensive; my injected compact CSS must include them. I'll craft a comprehensive injected style for the preview.\n\nLet me write careers.html first.","open":false,"collapse":"preview"},{"kind":"text","text":"I have the full picture of the site's conventions now. The CSS even has some careers scaffolding ready (`.job-listing`, `.careers-form`, `.careers-hero`). Let me build the full Careers page:"},{"kind":"tool","id":"0kdzvWiO5QE","toolName":"write_todos","input":{"todos":[{"task":"Study existing page structure (nav, footer, forms, JS conventions)","completed":true},{"task":"Create careers.html with all 9 sections + both application forms","completed":false},{"task":"Add CSS for new components (job cards, timeline, benefits, values) to style.css","completed":false},{"task":"Verify page in preview and review code","completed":false}]}},{"kind":"tool","id":"0kit2rBxf_8","toolName":"write_file","input":{"path":"REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-/careers.html","instructions":"Create the full Careers / Recruitment Hub page for Reality FX following the site's existing conventions.","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Careers — Reality FX</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\"\n    content=\"Build your career with Reality FX. Join a team passionate about financial markets, education, and helping traders reach their full potential. View open positions and apply today.\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link\n    href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\"\n    rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Navigation -->\n  <nav class=\"nav\">\n    <div class=\"container nav-inner\">\n      <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"nav-logo\">Reality<span>FX</span></a>\n      <ul class=\"nav-links\">\n        <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"why-choose-us.html\">Why Us</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"our-services.html\">Services</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"industries.html\">Industries</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"programs.html\">Programs</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"evaluation.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding:0.6rem 1.2rem;font-size:0.7rem;\">Free\n            Evaluation</a></li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"hamburger\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <div class=\"mobile-menu\">\n    <a href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\n    <a href=\"why-choose-us.html\">Why Us</a>\n    <a href=\"our-services.html\">Services</a>\n    <a href=\"industries.html\">Industries</a>\n    <a href=\"programs.html\">Programs</a>\n    <a href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a>\n    <a href=\"evaluation.html\">Free Evaluation</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <section class=\"hero careers-hero\" style=\"min-height:70vh;padding-top:120px;\">\n    <div class=\"container\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Join Our Team</span>\n      <h1>Build Your Career With <span class=\"accent\">Reality FX</span></h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-subhead\" style=\"margin:0 auto;max-width:640px;\">Join a team passionate about financial markets,\n        innovation, education, and helping traders reach their full potential.</p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:1.5rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:2.5rem;\">\n        <a href=\"#positions\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-large\">View Open Positions</a>\n        <a href=\"#talent-pool\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-large\">Submit General Application</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Why Join Reality FX -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"why-join\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Why Join Reality FX</span>\n        <h2>More Than a Job — A Career</h2>\n        <p>We are a growing company. Joining now means you help shape what we become.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-grid why-grid reveal\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">📈</span>\n          <h3>Career Growth</h3>\n          <p>Clear progression paths and internal promotion. We promote from within whenever we can.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🌍</span>\n          <h3>Remote Opportunities</h3>\n          <p>Most roles are remote-first. Work from anywhere while staying connected to a tight-knit team.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🎓</span>\n          <h3>Continuous Learning</h3>\n          <p>Ongoing training, market education, and skill-building are part of the job — not an afterthought.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">💰</span>\n          <h3>Performance-Based Rewards</h3>\n          <p>Your results are recognised. Bonuses and commissions reward the value you create.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🤝</span>\n          <h3>Supportive Team</h3>\n          <p>A collaborative, respectful environment where questions are welcome and help is always near.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🚀</span>\n          <h3>Real Financial Projects</h3>\n          <p>Work on live market projects, real student outcomes, and products used every day.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Our Culture -->\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"background:var(--bg-deep);\" id=\"culture\">\n    <div class=\"container two-col reveal\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Culture</span>\n        <h2>Who We Are</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:1.5rem 0 2rem;line-height:1.9;\">At Reality FX, we believe in discipline, continuous\n          improvement, integrity, and data-driven decision making. We value people who enjoy solving problems,\n          learning new skills, and contributing to a collaborative environment.</p>\n        <a href=\"#positions\" class=\"btn btn-dark\">See Open Positions</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"value-grid\">\n        <div class=\"value-card\">\n          <span class=\"value-number\">01</span>\n          <h3>Integrity</h3>\n          <p>We do the right thing for our clients and each other — always.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"value-card\">\n          <span class=\"value-number\">02</span>\n          <h3>Excellence</h3>\n          <p>Good enough is never enough. We sweat the details.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"value-card\">\n          <span class=\"value-number\">03</span>\n          <h3>Innovation</h3>\n          <p>Markets evolve. So do we — new tools, new ideas, new edge.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"value-card\">\n          <span class=\"value-number\">04</span>\n          <h3>Discipline</h3>\n          <p>Consistent process beats occasional brilliance. Every time.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Open Positions -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"positions\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Open Positions</span>\n        <h2>Find Your Role</h2>\n        <p>Explore our current openings. Even if nothing fits today, join our talent pool below.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Trading -->\n      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Trading</h3>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Technical Analyst</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>2+ Years</span>\n            <span>Salary: R25,000 – R40,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Produce high-probability technical setups, market commentary, and trade plans for our signal and\n            mentorship programs.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Technical Analysis</li>\n            <li>Market Structure</li>\n            <li>Price Action</li>\n            <li>MetaTrader</li>\n            <li>TradingView</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Technical Analyst\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Fundamental Analyst</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>2+ Years</span>\n            <span>Salary: R25,000 – R40,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Track macro events, central bank policy, and economic data to build the fundamental layer of our\n            market outlook.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Macro Economics</li>\n            <li>News &amp; Event Analysis</li>\n            <li>Data Interpretation</li>\n            <li>Report Writing</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Fundamental Analyst\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Risk Manager</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>3+ Years</span>\n            <span>Salary: R30,000 – R45,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Design and enforce position-sizing rules, drawdown controls, and portfolio risk frameworks across all\n            programs.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Risk Frameworks</li>\n            <li>Position Sizing</li>\n            <li>Portfolio Management</li>\n            <li>Spreadsheet / Data Skills</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Risk Manager\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Trading Mentor</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>2+ Years</span>\n            <span>Salary: R20,000 – R35,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Guide students through their trading journey with live sessions, account reviews, and structured\n            accountability.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Proven Track Record</li>\n            <li>Teaching / Coaching</li>\n            <li>Risk Management</li>\n            <li>Strong Communication</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Trading Mentor\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Junior Trader</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>Entry Level</span>\n            <span>Salary: R15,000 – R25,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Train under senior mentors, execute defined strategies, and grow into a full analyst role. A great\n            first step into the industry.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Basic Market Knowledge</li>\n            <li>Discipline &amp; Process</li>\n            <li>Willingness to Learn</li>\n            <li>MetaTrader (a plus)</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Junior Trader\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Education -->\n      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Education</h3>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Forex Instructor</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>2+ Years</span>\n            <span>Salary: R18,000 – R30,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Deliver live lessons and structured curriculum across our academy tiers, from foundations to advanced\n            strategy.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Deep Market Knowledge</li>\n            <li>Public Speaking</li>\n            <li>Curriculum Delivery</li>\n            <li>Patience &amp; Clarity</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Forex Instructor\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Trading Coach</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Part-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>1+ Year</span>\n            <span>Salary: R18,000 – R28,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Work one-on-one with students to review their trading psychology, journaling, and execution habits.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Coaching Experience</li>\n            <li>Psychology / Mindset</li>\n            <li>Trade Journaling</li>\n            <li>Empathy</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Trading Coach\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Marketing -->\n      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Marketing</h3>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Digital Marketing Specialist</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>2+ Years</span>\n            <span>Salary: R18,000 – R30,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Own paid campaigns, funnels, and analytics that bring the right students and partners to Reality FX.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Meta / Google Ads</li>\n            <li>Funnel Building</li>\n            <li>Analytics</li>\n            <li>Copywriting (a plus)</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Digital Marketing Specialist\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Content Creator</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>1+ Year</span>\n            <span>Salary: R12,000 – R20,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Create short-form video and written content that educates and inspires our community across platforms.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Short-Form Video</li>\n            <li>Scripting</li>\n            <li>Basic Editing</li>\n            <li>Trend Awareness</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Content Creator\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Sales -->\n      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Sales</h3>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Sales Consultant</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>1+ Year</span>\n            <span>R12,000 Base + Commission</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Guide prospects through our evaluation and program options, matching them to the right tier.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Consultative Selling</li>\n            <li>CRM Usage</li>\n            <li>Strong Follow-Up</li>\n            <li>Resilience</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Sales Consultant\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Client Success Manager</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>2+ Years</span>\n            <span>Salary: R15,000 – R25,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Keep our students engaged and succeeding — onboarding, check-ins, and renewals with a personal touch.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Client Onboarding</li>\n            <li>Relationship Building</li>\n            <li>Retention Strategy</li>\n            <li>Empathy</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Client Success Manager\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Technology -->\n      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Technology</h3>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Frontend Developer</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>2+ Years</span>\n            <span>Salary: R30,000 – R50,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Build and maintain our websites, dashboards, and member portal with a focus on speed and polish.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>HTML / CSS / JavaScript</li>\n            <li>React or Vue</li>\n            <li>Responsive Design</li>\n            <li>Git Workflows</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Frontend Developer\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>UI/UX Designer</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>2+ Years</span>\n            <span>Salary: R22,000 – R38,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Design clean, conversion-focused interfaces for our site, student portal, and learning materials.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Figma</li>\n            <li>Design Systems</li>\n            <li>Prototyping</li>\n            <li>User Research</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"UI/UX Designer\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Data Analyst</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>2+ Years</span>\n            <span>Salary: R25,000 – R40,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Turn trading, student, and marketing data into clear dashboards and decisions.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>SQL</li>\n            <li>Python or R</li>\n            <li>Data Visualisation</li>\n            <li>Statistical Thinking</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Data Analyst\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Administration -->\n      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Administration</h3>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Operations Manager</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Full-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>3+ Years</span>\n            <span>Salary: R25,000 – R40,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Keep the machine running — processes, tooling, vendors, and cross-team coordination.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Process Design</li>\n            <li>Project Management</li>\n            <li>Tooling (CRM / PM)</li>\n            <li>Leadership</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Operations Manager\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n          <div class=\"job-head\">\n            <h3>Virtual Assistant</h3>\n            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n            <span>Part-Time</span>\n            <span>Remote</span>\n            <span>Entry Level</span>\n            <span>Salary: R8,000 – R15,000 / mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>Support the leadership team with scheduling, admin, and communication. A great role for detail-oriented\n            starters.</p>\n          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n            <li>Organisation</li>\n            <li>Communication</li>\n            <li>Google Workspace</li>\n            <li>Reliability</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Virtual Assistant\">Apply Now</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Hiring Process -->\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"background:var(--bg-deep);\" id=\"process\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Hiring Process</span>\n        <h2>From Application to Welcome</h2>\n        <p>Transparent, structured, and usually completed within 1–3 weeks.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"timeline reveal\">\n        <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n          <div class=\"timeline-dot\">1</div>\n          <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n            <h3>Application</h3>\n            <p>Submit your CV and cover letter through the form below. It takes about five minutes.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n          <div class=\"timeline-dot\">2</div>\n          <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n            <h3>Initial Review</h3>\n            <p>Our team reviews every application and shortlists candidates within 3–5 business days.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n          <div class=\"timeline-dot\">3</div>\n          <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n            <h3>Skills Assessment</h3>\n            <p>A short, role-specific assessment helps us understand your strengths in practice, not just on paper.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n          <div class=\"timeline-dot\">4</div>\n          <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n            <h3>Interview</h3>\n            <p>Meet the team. We focus on how you think and solve problems, not rehearsed answers.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n          <div class=\"timeline-dot\">5</div>\n          <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n            <h3>Final Decision</h3>\n            <p>Successful candidates receive an offer within a week of the final interview.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n          <div class=\"timeline-dot\">6</div>\n          <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n            <h3>Welcome to Reality FX</h3>\n            <p>Onboarding, tooling, and a mentor to help you hit the ground running from day one.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Employee Benefits -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"benefits\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Employee Benefits</span>\n        <h2>What You Get Working With Us</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"benefit-grid reveal\">\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🏠</span>\n          <h3>Remote Work</h3>\n          <p>Work from anywhere. We hire by talent, not by postcode.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">📚</span>\n          <h3>Professional Development</h3>\n          <p>Budget for courses, certifications, and industry events.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">⏰</span>\n          <h3>Flexible Hours</h3>\n          <p>Own your schedule while hitting your targets.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">💰</span>\n          <h3>Performance Bonuses</h3>\n          <p>Share in the success you help create.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🧑‍🏫</span>\n          <h3>Mentorship</h3>\n          <p>Learn directly from senior traders and leaders.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🎓</span>\n          <h3>Certification Opportunities</h3>\n          <p>Earn recognised credentials as you grow.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🤝</span>\n          <h3>Networking</h3>\n          <p>Connect with a growing community of professionals.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">📈</span>\n          <h3>Career Advancement</h3>\n          <p>Clear paths to leadership and specialisation.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- FAQ -->\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"background:var(--bg-deep);\" id=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Frequently Asked Questions</span>\n        <h2>Before You Apply</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"reveal\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-header\">Can I work remotely?<span class=\"accordion-icon\">+</span></button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n            <p>Yes. Most roles at Reality FX are remote-first, and many of our team members work across different\n              time zones. All you need is a reliable internet connection and the discipline to deliver.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-header\">Can beginners apply?<span class=\"accordion-icon\">+</span></button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n            <p>It depends on the role. Entry-level positions such as Junior Trader, Virtual Assistant, and Content\n              Creator are open to beginners with the right attitude. Specialist roles list the experience they\n              require — please read each posting carefully.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-header\">Is trading experience required?<span class=\"accordion-icon\">+</span></button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n            <p>Only for trading positions. Education, marketing, sales, technology, and administration roles do not\n              require trading experience — though an interest in the markets is always welcome.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-header\">How long does hiring take?<span class=\"accordion-icon\">+</span></button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n            <p>Normally 1–3 weeks from application to final decision, depending on the number of applications and\n              how quickly we can schedule your interview.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-header\">Can international applicants apply?<span class=\"accordion-icon\">+</span></button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n            <p>Yes. We welcome applicants from anywhere in the world. If you are offered a role, we will work with\n              you on the best working arrangement for your location.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Job Application -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"apply\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Apply For A Position</span>\n        <h2>Job Application</h2>\n        <p>Fill in the form below. If you clicked \"Apply Now\" on a position, it is already selected for you.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"careers-form reveal\">\n        <form name=\"job-application\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\" netlify-honeypot=\"bot-field\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"job-application\">\n          <p style=\"display:none;\"><label>Don't fill this out: <input name=\"bot-field\"></label></p>\n\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"full-name\">Full Name *</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"full-name\" name=\"full-name\" required>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"email\">Email *</label>\n              <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"phone\">Phone</label>\n              <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"country\">Country *</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"country\" name=\"country\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"position\">Position Applying For *</label>\n              <select id=\"position\" name=\"position\" required>\n                <option value=\"\" disabled selected>Select a position</option>\n                <option>Technical Analyst</option>\n                <option>Fundamental Analyst</option>\n                <option>Risk Manager</option>\n                <option>Trading Mentor</option>\n                <option>Junior Trader</option>\n                <option>Forex Instructor</option>\n                <option>Trading Coach</option>\n                <option>Digital Marketing Specialist</option>\n                <option>Content Creator</option>\n                <option>Sales Consultant</option>\n                <option>Client Success Manager</option>\n                <option>Frontend Developer</option>\n                <option>UI/UX Designer</option>\n                <option>Data Analyst</option>\n                <option>Operations Manager</option>\n                <option>Virtual Assistant</option>\n                <option>General Application</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"salary\">Expected Salary (optional)</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"salary\" name=\"salary\" placeholder=\"e.g. R25,000 per month\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"start-date\">Earliest Start Date (optional)</label>\n              <input type=\"date\" id=\"start-date\" name=\"start-date\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"experience\">Years of Experience *</label>\n              <select id=\"experience\" name=\"experience\" required>\n                <option value=\"\" disabled selected>Select experience</option>\n                <option>Less than 1 year</option>\n                <option>1–2 years</option>\n                <option>3–5 years</option>\n                <option>5–10 years</option>\n                <option>10+ years</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"interest\">Area of Interest *</label>\n              <select id=\"interest\" name=\"interest\" required>\n                <option value=\"\" disabled selected>Select a department</option>\n                <option>Trading</option>\n                <option>Education</option>\n                <option>Marketing</option>\n                <option>Sales</option>\n                <option>Technology</option>\n                <option>Administration</option>\n                <option>Other</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"cv\">CV Upload (PDF or DOC)</label>\n              <input type=\"file\" id=\"cv\" name=\"cv\" accept=\".pdf,.doc,.docx\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"linkedin\">LinkedIn (optional)</label>\n              <input type=\"url\" id=\"linkedin\" name=\"linkedin\" placeholder=\"https://linkedin.com/in/...\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"portfolio\">Portfolio or GitHub (optional)</label>\n              <input type=\"url\" id=\"portfolio\" name=\"portfolio\" placeholder=\"https://...\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"cover-letter\">Cover Letter *</label>\n            <textarea id=\"cover-letter\" name=\"cover-letter\" required\n              placeholder=\"Tell us why you are the right person for this role...\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-large\">Submit Application</button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- General Application / Talent Pool -->\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"background:var(--bg-deep);\" id=\"talent-pool\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Talent Pool</span>\n        <h2>Don't See the Perfect Role?</h2>\n        <p>Submit your CV anyway. We keep a talent pool of great people and reach out when the right role opens.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"careers-form reveal\">\n        <form name=\"general-application\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\" netlify-honeypot=\"bot-field\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"general-application\">\n          <p style=\"display:none;\"><label>Don't fill this out: <input name=\"bot-field\"></label></p>\n\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"g-full-name\">Full Name *</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"g-full-name\" name=\"full-name\" required>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"g-email\">Email *</label>\n              <input type=\"email\" id=\"g-email\" name=\"email\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"g-phone\">Phone</label>\n              <input type=\"tel\" id=\"g-phone\" name=\"phone\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"g-country\">Country *</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"g-country\" name=\"country\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"g-experience\">Years of Experience</label>\n              <select id=\"g-experience\" name=\"experience\">\n                <option value=\"\" selected>Select experience</option>\n                <option>Less than 1 year</option>\n                <option>1–2 years</option>\n                <option>3–5 years</option>\n                <option>5–10 years</option>\n                <option>10+ years</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"g-interest\">Areas of Interest *</label>\n              <select id=\"g-interest\" name=\"interest\" required>\n                <option value=\"\" disabled selected>Select a department</option>\n                <option>Trading</option>\n                <option>Education</option>\n                <option>Marketing</option>\n                <option>Sales</option>\n                <option>Technology</option>\n                <option>Administration</option>\n                <option>Other</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"g-cv\">CV Upload (PDF or DOC)</label>\n              <input type=\"file\" id=\"g-cv\" name=\"cv\" accept=\".pdf,.doc,.docx\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"g-linkedin\">LinkedIn (optional)</label>\n              <input type=\"url\" id=\"g-linkedin\" name=\"linkedin\" placeholder=\"https://linkedin.com/in/...\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"g-cover-letter\">Cover Letter</label>\n            <textarea id=\"g-cover-letter\" name=\"cover-letter\"\n              placeholder=\"Tell us about yourself and the kind of role you are looking for...\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-large\">Join Our Talent Pool</button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- CTA -->\n  <section class=\"cta-section\">\n    <div class=\"container reveal\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n      <h2>Ready to Build Your Future With Reality FX?</h2>\n      <p style=\"margin:1.5rem auto 2.5rem;max-width:600px;\">Take the first step. We would love to hear from you.</p>\n      <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-large\">Apply Today</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"footer-brand\">Reality<span>FX</span></div>\n          <p class=\"footer-about\">Premium trading education and mentorship since 2020. We transform retail traders into\n            disciplined, profitable market participants.</p>\n          <div class=\"footer-social\">\n            <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"X\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                <path\n                  d=\"M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z\" />\n              </svg></a>\n            <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"\n                stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" />\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5\" />\n                <circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"1.5\" />\n    