al promotion. We promote from within whenever we can.</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"card\">\n+          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🌍</span>\n+          <h3>Remote Opportunities</h3>\n+          <p>Most roles are remote-first. Work from anywhere while staying connected to a tight-knit team.</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"card\">\n+          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🎓</span>\n+          <h3>Continuous Learning</h3>\n+          <p>Ongoing training, market education, and skill-building are part of the job — not an afterthought.</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"card\">\n+          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">💰</span>\n+          <h3>Performance-Based Rewards</h3>\n+          <p>Your results are recognised. Bonuses and commissions reward the value you create.</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"card\">\n+          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🤝</span>\n+          <h3>Supportive Team</h3>\n+          <p>A collaborative, respectful environment where questions are welcome and help is always near.</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"card\">\n+          <span class=\"icon-emoji\">🚀</span>\n+          <h3>Real Financial Projects</h3>\n+          <p>Work on live market projects, real student outcomes, and products used every day.</p>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+  </section>\n+\n+  <!-- Our Culture -->\n+  <section class=\"section\" style=\"background:var(--bg-deep);\" id=\"culture\">\n+    <div class=\"container two-col reveal\">\n+      <div>\n+        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Culture</span>\n+        <h2>Who We Are</h2>\n+        <p style=\"margin:1.5rem 0 2rem;line-height:1.9;\">At Reality FX, we believe in discipline, continuous\n+          improvement, integrity, and data-driven decision making. We value people who enjoy solving problems,\n+          learning new skills, and contributing to a collaborative environment.</p>\n+        <a href=\"#positions\" class=\"btn btn-dark\">See Open Positions</a>\n+      </div>\n+      <div class=\"value-grid\">\n+        <div class=\"value-card\">\n+          <span class=\"value-number\">01</span>\n+          <h3>Integrity</h3>\n+          <p>We do the right thing for our clients and each other — always.</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"value-card\">\n+          <span class=\"value-number\">02</span>\n+          <h3>Excellence</h3>\n+          <p>Good enough is never enough. We sweat the details.</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"value-card\">\n+          <span class=\"value-number\">03</span>\n+          <h3>Innovation</h3>\n+          <p>Markets evolve. So do we — new tools, new ideas, new edge.</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"value-card\">\n+          <span class=\"value-number\">04</span>\n+          <h3>Discipline</h3>\n+          <p>Consistent process beats occasional brilliance. Every time.</p>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+  </section>\n+\n+  <!-- Open Positions -->\n+  <section class=\"section\" id=\"positions\">\n+    <div class=\"container\">\n+      <div class=\"section-header reveal\">\n+        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Open Positions</span>\n+        <h2>Find Your Role</h2>\n+        <p>Explore our current openings. Even if nothing fits today, join our talent pool below.</p>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- Trading -->\n+      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n+        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Trading</h3>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Technical Analyst</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>2+ Years</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R25,000 – R40,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Produce high-probability technical setups, market commentary, and trade plans for our signal and\n+            mentorship programs.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Technical Analysis</li>\n+            <li>Market Structure</li>\n+            <li>Price Action</li>\n+            <li>MetaTrader</li>\n+            <li>TradingView</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Technical Analyst\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Fundamental Analyst</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>2+ Years</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R25,000 – R40,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Track macro events, central bank policy, and economic data to build the fundamental layer of our\n+            market outlook.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Macro Economics</li>\n+            <li>News &amp; Event Analysis</li>\n+            <li>Data Interpretation</li>\n+            <li>Report Writing</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Fundamental Analyst\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Risk Manager</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>3+ Years</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R30,000 – R45,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Design and enforce position-sizing rules, drawdown controls, and portfolio risk frameworks across all\n+            programs.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Risk Frameworks</li>\n+            <li>Position Sizing</li>\n+            <li>Portfolio Management</li>\n+            <li>Spreadsheet / Data Skills</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Risk Manager\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Trading Mentor</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>2+ Years</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R20,000 – R35,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Guide students through their trading journey with live sessions, account reviews, and structured\n+            accountability.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Proven Track Record</li>\n+            <li>Teaching / Coaching</li>\n+            <li>Risk Management</li>\n+            <li>Strong Communication</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Trading Mentor\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Junior Trader</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>Entry Level</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R15,000 – R25,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Train under senior mentors, execute defined strategies, and grow into a full analyst role. A great\n+            first step into the industry.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Basic Market Knowledge</li>\n+            <li>Discipline &amp; Process</li>\n+            <li>Willingness to Learn</li>\n+            <li>MetaTrader (a plus)</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Junior Trader\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- Education -->\n+      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n+        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Education</h3>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Forex Instructor</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>2+ Years</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R18,000 – R30,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Deliver live lessons and structured curriculum across our academy tiers, from foundations to advanced\n+            strategy.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Deep Market Knowledge</li>\n+            <li>Public Speaking</li>\n+            <li>Curriculum Delivery</li>\n+            <li>Patience &amp; Clarity</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Forex Instructor\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Trading Coach</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Part-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>1+ Year</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R18,000 – R28,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Work one-on-one with students to review their trading psychology, journaling, and execution habits.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Coaching Experience</li>\n+            <li>Psychology / Mindset</li>\n+            <li>Trade Journaling</li>\n+            <li>Empathy</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Trading Coach\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- Marketing -->\n+      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n+        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Marketing</h3>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Digital Marketing Specialist</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>2+ Years</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R18,000 – R30,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Own paid campaigns, funnels, and analytics that bring the right students and partners to Reality FX.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Meta / Google Ads</li>\n+            <li>Funnel Building</li>\n+            <li>Analytics</li>\n+            <li>Copywriting (a plus)</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Digital Marketing Specialist\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Content Creator</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>1+ Year</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R12,000 – R20,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Create short-form video and written content that educates and inspires our community across platforms.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Short-Form Video</li>\n+            <li>Scripting</li>\n+            <li>Basic Editing</li>\n+            <li>Trend Awareness</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Content Creator\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- Sales -->\n+      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n+        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Sales</h3>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Sales Consultant</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>1+ Year</span>\n+            <span>R12,000 Base + Commission</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Guide prospects through our evaluation and program options, matching them to the right tier.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Consultative Selling</li>\n+            <li>CRM Usage</li>\n+            <li>Strong Follow-Up</li>\n+            <li>Resilience</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Sales Consultant\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Client Success Manager</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>2+ Years</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R15,000 – R25,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Keep our students engaged and succeeding — onboarding, check-ins, and renewals with a personal touch.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Client Onboarding</li>\n+            <li>Relationship Building</li>\n+            <li>Retention Strategy</li>\n+            <li>Empathy</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Client Success Manager\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- Technology -->\n+      <div class=\"department-group reveal\">\n+        <h3 class=\"department-title\">Technology</h3>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Frontend Developer</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>2+ Years</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R30,000 – R50,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Build and maintain our websites, dashboards, and member portal with a focus on speed and polish.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>HTML / CSS / JavaScript</li>\n+            <li>React or Vue</li>\n+            <li>Responsive Design</li>\n+            <li>Git Workflows</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"Frontend Developer\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>UI/UX Designer</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>2+ Years</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R22,000 – R38,000 / mo</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <p>Design clean, conversion-focused interfaces for our site, student portal, and learning materials.</p>\n+          <ul class=\"job-requirements\">\n+            <li>Figma</li>\n+            <li>Design Systems</li>\n+            <li>Prototyping</li>\n+            <li>User Research</li>\n+          </ul>\n+          <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-position=\"UI/UX Designer\">Apply Now</a>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div class=\"job-listing\">\n+          <div class=\"job-head\">\n+            <h3>Data Analyst</h3>\n+            <span class=\"job-badge\">Remote</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"job-meta\">\n+            <span>Full-Time</span>\n+            <span>Remote</span>\n+            <span>2+ Years</span>\n+            <span>Salary: R25,000 – R40,000 / mo</