ately on DOM add (before .visible) — the first cycle might be partially done when visible — acceptable, or use animation-play-state. Keep simple.\n\n**Modal check glow**:\n```css\n.modal-check {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 88px; height: 88px;\n  margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  color: var(--accent-gold);\n}\n.modal-check::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201,162,39,0.35), transparent 70%);\n  filter: blur(6px);\n  animation: modal-glow-pulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n@keyframes modal-glow-pulse {\n  0%, 100% { transform: scale(0.9); opacity: 0.7; }\n  50% { transform: scale(1.15); opacity: 1; }\n}\n.modal-check svg { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n```\n\n**Modal card**:\n```css\n.form-overlay {\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 2000;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 1.5rem;\n  background: rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.72);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n  opacity: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  transition: opacity 0.45s ease;\n}\n.form-overlay.visible {\n  opacity: 1;\n  pointer-events: auto;\n}\n.form-modal {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 460px;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 3rem 2.5rem;\n  background: linear-gradient(160deg, #151210, #0a0a0a);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 60px rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.08);\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(18px) scale(0.94);\n  transition: opacity 0.5s ease 0.1s, transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.1s;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.form-overlay.visible .form-modal {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateY(0) scale(1);\n}\n.form-modal h3 {\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  color: var(--accent-gold);\n  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(10