* → \"Message Sent\" — *\"A member of our team will get back to you within 24 hours.\"*\n- **Evaluation** → \"Assessment Received\" — *\"We'll contact you within 24 hours with a personalised program recommendation.\"*\n\n**Closing is equally smooth** — Continue button, clicking the backdrop, or pressing **Esc** all fade the modal out instantly (I fixed the close animation so it doesn't linger), then the form is reset and ready for the next visitor.\n\n**Polish details from review:** the staggered reveal delays only apply on entry (exit stays instant), the glow/sparks start exactly when the modal appears, the modal announces itself to screen readers (`aria-labelledby`), and focus moves to the Continue button when it opens.\n\nEverything was tested live in the preview — the check draw animation runs, all 5 sparks appear, and the close flow restores the form cleanly. Submit one of your forms for real and you'll see the full choreography. 🎉"},{"kind":"changes","id":"p14-7c5cc987","files":[{"path":"REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css","status":"modified","lockfile":false,"binary":false,"adds":194,"dels":12,"patch":"Index: REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css\n===================================================================\n--- REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css\tbefore\n+++ REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css\tafter\n@@ -2396,27 +2396,209 @@\n   }\r\n }\r\n \r\n-/* ── Form success / error states (Formspree AJAX) ── */\r\n-.form-success {\r\n+/* ── Form success modal (Formspree AJAX) ── */\r\n+.form-overlay {\r\n+  position: fixed;\r\n+  inset: 0;\r\n+  z-index: 2000;\r\n+  display: flex;\r\n+  align-items: center;\r\n+  justify-content: center;\r\n+  padding: 1.5rem;\r\n+  background: rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.72);\r\n+  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\r\n+  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\r\n+  opacity: 0;\r\n+  pointer-events: none;\r\n+  transition: opacity 0.45s ease;\r\n+}\r\n+\r\n+.form-overlay.visible {\r\n+  opacity: 1;\r\n+  pointer-events: auto;\r\n+}\r