h the curriculum and shows the level of depth.\n- Then the refund policy: \"If you complete Chapter One and you're not convinced, we'll refund you in full — no questions asked. After Chapter One, refunds don't apply.\"\n\nAlso the abundance-mindset framing: \"We're not here to take your money — we're here to transform your trading. That's why we put our money where our mouth is: if you finish Chapter One and genuinely feel the course isn't for you, we'll refund every cent. No forms, no fuss. After Chapter One, the course content and mentorship have real value being delivered, so refunds close at that point.\"\n\nLet me write the Refund Policy content with this solution baked in:\n\n```\n<strong>Our Promise — We Are Not Here to Take Your Money.</strong> Reality FX exists to transform traders, not to collect fees. That is why our refund policy is built on abundance, not protection: if you enrol and, after completing Chapter One, you genuinely feel the course is not for you, we will refund your payment in full — no questions asked, no lengthy processes.\n<strong>The Chapter One Window.</strong> You are entitled to a 100% refund within 14 days of purchase or after completing Chapter One of the curriculum — whichever comes first. Once you move past Chapter One, refunds no longer apply, because from that point the full depth of the course — advanced strategy, risk frameworks, mentorship — is actively being delivered to you.\n<strong>So You Can See the Depth Before You Commit.</strong> We know Chapter One is a foundation — deliberately accessible so every student starts on the same solid footing. To make the full depth visible before you pay a cent, every prospective student can access our free curriculum preview, which maps exactly what Chapters 2–13 cover. If you are curious about the depth, preview it before you enrol — no purchase needed.\n<strong>How to Request a Refund.</strong> Email us at realityfx20@gmail.com with your name and payment reference within the refund 