noticeably more present:\n\n- **Bigger specks** — 3px → **5px** dots\n- **Stronger glow** — the golden halo around each speck is brighter and wider, so they read as tiny glowing motes rather than faint pinpricks\n- **Higher peak visibility** — opacity rises to **0.65** at their brightest (up from 0.45), and stays visible longer through the float\n- **A touch more travel** — they drift a bit further upward, so the motion reads clearly\n\nStill classy: they remain behind the text, gentle and slow, and never crowd the headline. CSS braces still balance (426/426). Reload the homepage and you should see the gold drifting clearly around \"Game Changers\" and the buttons now. 🐂✨"},{"kind":"tool","id":"1frjMTy5rKc","toolName":"suggest_prompts","input":{"prompts":[{"prompt":"Add a few gold specks that drift down from the top of the hero (like falling gold) in addition to the rising ones, so the atmosphere feels even richer.","label":"Let dust drift from above"},{"prompt":"Make the hero dust particles drift at different speeds when the user scrolls (subtle parallax) so the whole hero feels deeper and more alive.","label":"Parallax dust on scroll"},{"prompt":"Now that the ambient dust is more visible, does the bull's right-side dust feel consistent? Compare both sides and even them out if needed.","label":"Balance dust on both sides"}]}},{"kind":"changes","id":"p5-21f09ab7","files":[{"path":"REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css","status":"modified","lockfile":false,"binary":false,"adds":6,"dels":6,"patch":"Index: REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css\n===================================================================\n--- REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css\tbefore\n+++ REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css\tafter\n@@ -453,11 +453,11 @@\n \r\n .hero-content .ambient-dust {\r\n   position: absolute;\r\n-  width: 3px;\r\n-  height: 3px;\r\n+  width: 5px;\r\n+  height: 5px;\r\n   border-radius: 50%;\r\n   background: var(--accent-gold-light);\r\n-  box-shadow: 0 0 6px 1.5