\nVerified: braces balanced (378/378), 2 sweeps live in the DOM, beam spans ~23% of hero width and travels the full frame. Reload the homepage — the light now rolls smoothly across the whole cinematic hero, over the bull *and* the text side. 🌟"},{"kind":"tool","id":"1k9ALz8ir_c","toolName":"suggest_prompts","input":{"prompts":[{"prompt":"The full-hero sweep looks good — should it run slower and linger over the bull a moment, or stay at the current pace? Compare both feels.","label":"Tune sweep pacing"},{"prompt":"Now that the sweep passes over the text, should it also gently highlight the headline in gold as it passes (brief color shift) for extra elegance?","label":"Highlight headline as sweep passes"},{"prompt":"The sweep is subtle over the bright parts of the image — make the beam slightly stronger near the bull and softer near the text for balance.","label":"Taper sweep intensity"}]}},{"kind":"changes","id":"p7-45a677b2","files":[{"path":"REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css","status":"modified","lockfile":false,"binary":false,"adds":45,"dels":1,"patch":"Index: REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css\n===================================================================\n--- REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css\tbefore\n+++ REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-\\css\\style.css\tafter\n@@ -444,13 +444,57 @@\n   pointer-events: none;\n }\n \n+/* Gold light sweep — glides across the WHOLE hero, never leaving the frame */\n+.hero-sweep {\n+  position: absolute;\n+  top: 0;\n+  left: -18%;\n+  width: 22%;\n+  height: 100%;\n+  transform: skewX(-14deg);\n+  background: linear-gradient(90deg,\n+      transparent 0%,\n+      rgba(229, 193, 88, 0.09) 40%,\n+      rgba(229, 193, 88, 0.4) 50%,\n+      rgba(229, 193, 88, 0.09) 60%,\n+      transparent 100%);\n+  mix-blend-mode: overlay;\n+  pointer-events: none;\n+  z-index: 2;\n+  animation: hero-shine 7s ease-in-out infinite;\n+}\n+\n+.hero-sweep-2 {\n+  animation-delay: 3.5s;\n+}\n+\n+@keyframes hero-shine {\n+  0% {\n+    left: -18%;