t, which I'll proceed with unless you say otherwise:\n\n1. **Content path:** Option A — extract your slide images, launch fast, keep your exact visual design\n2. **Answer keys:** I draft from your content → you verify each chapter\n3. **Payments:** EFT + manual access-granting from an admin screen (SA-friendly), with online checkout as an add-on later\n4. **Access model:** OS included with the RFX Full Course, elevated features for Virtual Mentor tier\n5. **Name:** \"Reality FX OS,\" with a **Student Login** button on the site navbar\n\nSay **\"go\"** and I'll start Phase 1 — I'll begin with the two pieces that don't depend on anything else: extracting all ~740 slide images into the project, and drafting the Chapter 1 answer key so you can see the format and check my work before I do all 13."},{"kind":"tool","id":"1zKcW0sXwBs","toolName":"suggest_prompts","input":{"prompts":[{"prompt":"Go — start Phase 1 with the recommended defaults. Begin by extracting all ~740 slide images from the 13 chapter PDFs into the project, then build the OS Foundation app shell.","label":"Go — start Phase 1"},{"prompt":"Extract all ~740 lesson slide images from the 13 chapter PDFs into an assets folder inside the project so we can see exactly what the lesson player will display.","label":"Extract the slide images now"},{"prompt":"Draft the answer key for Chapter 1's pop quiz from the extracted content, showing the format, so I can verify it before you do all 13 chapters.","label":"Draft the Chapter 1 answer key first"}]}}],"ts":1786021847230},{"role":"user","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"1. I think for now we can use the images i created for now, and perhaps down the line when we get time we can recreate them, because some in fact most of those images were created by me so to find scenarios online with the same concept would be hard, you would have to recreate from scratch which i know you can but that would tak time so im find with A\n\n2. Yes absolutely\n\n3. With Online checkout we h