ts, certificate teaser\n+- **Journey Map:** 13 nodes, unlock gating (all slides viewed + quiz ≥70%)\n+- **Lesson Player:** 741 slide images, watermark, keyboard nav, progress bar\n+- **Quiz Engine:** checkpoint quizzes with instant feedback + explanations, first-attempt scoring, retake flow, self-assessment poll\n+- **Ch 1–2 quiz banks live** (43 questions, answers drafted); **Ch 3–13** load once keys are verified\n+- **Ranks:** Novice → Student → Analyst → Risk-Aware → Strategist → Institution\n+- **Progress:** localStorage (per-device); Firebase accounts are Phase 2\n+- **Certificate view** built; unlocks at 13/13\n+- **Verified end-to-end:** full Chapter 1 walkthrough — slides, quiz 100%, chapter complete, Chapter 2 unlocks\n+\n+### Next steps\n+1. Verify Ch 1–2 answer keys → then I draft keys for Ch 3–13 chapter by chapter\n+2. Extract-then-hide: keep slide assets out of public URLs until Phase 2 gating\n+3. Phase 2: Firebase auth + admin access-granting + PayFast checkout links\n+4. Phase 2/3: Journal, Experience scenarios (Ch 4/5/9 engines), Laboratory\n","tooLarge":false}]}],"ts":1786024696282},{"role":"user","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"And one thing im most grateful for is that i hardly get the time to backtrack and check if there are no errors in the course, but luckily for me you have the ability to read all these files all in a couple minutes, it would take me a day or even more to just go through the risk management chapter alone 😭 (which in my opinion is the most important aspect of trading completely) so where you think you need to add your input to increase the quality of the course by providing extra helpful info, hacks, tricks and your crazy intelligence we could create the most powerful trading tutoring academy ever (so quality control bassicaly)\n\nI love everything that you said sounds powerful, im ready!!!"}],"ts":1786024696335},{"role":"assistant","parts":[{"kind":"reasoning","id":"p1-409297b5","text":"The user is excited and wants quality 