d bug: `root.querySelector` on root — the card wasn't in root yet. Fix that one line.\n\nLet me fix and also make it defensive.","open":false,"collapse":"preview"},{"kind":"text","text":"Found a real bug — the dashboard has been silently truncating after the stats since the start: the rank card is queried from the DOM **before** it's appended, which throws and kills the rest of the view. Fixing:"},{"kind":"tool","id":"13HgD342Rek","toolName":"str_replace","input":{"path":"REALITY-FOREX-TRADING-/os/js/os.js","replacements":[{"oldString":"    root.querySelector(\".rank-card [data-go]\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => location.hash = \"#/map\");\n    root.appendChild(rankCard);","newString":"    const rankGo = rankCard.querySelector(\"[data-go]\");\n    if (rankGo) rankGo.addEventListener(\"click\", () => location.hash = \"#/map\");\n    root.appendChild(rankCard);","allowMultiple":false}]}},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"},{"kind":"tool","id":"13H1wiMHLxM","toolName":"preview_navigate","input":{"to":"http://127.0.0.1:8910/os/index.html#/dashboard"}},{"kind":"tool","id":"13INilH55OE","toolName":"preview_evaluate","input":{"expression":"(() => ({\n  hasRankCard: !!document.querySelector('.rank-card'),\n  hasCertTeaser: !!document.querySelector('.cert-teaser'),\n  soonChips: [...document.querySelectorAll('.soon-chip')].map(c => c.querySelector('svg') ? 'svg+' + c.textContent.trim().slice(0, 25) : c.textContent.trim()),\n  hasNameBox: !!document.querySelector('.name-box'),\n  ctaMargin: getComputedStyle(document.querySelector('.dash-cta')).marginBottom\n}))()"}},{"kind":"reasoning","id":"p10-8dc92781","text":"Still truncated — hasRankCard false. Same stale-JS issue: navigating to `...#/dashboard` from the current URL (`...#/dashboard`?) — wait, the current URL was `http://127.0.0.1:8910/os/index.html` (no hash) and I navigated to `...#/dashboard` — that's a hash-only change on the OLD page (old JS without the fix). The fix is on disk but the page hasn't reloaded.\n\nI need 